threads should be able to safely read from the table at any time. In my
example, I=E2=80=99m sticking to what is available to C++11, just because t=
hat=E2=80=99s
what I had available when implementing my previous version.</p>

<p>We can now see the definition of that <code class=3D"language-plaintext =
highlighter-rouge">CMRC_INIT</code> macro as well. We=E2=80=99ll get to
that shortly. For now, we can leave it aside.</p>

