need to tell <code class=3D"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">CMakeRC</=
code> how to rewrite the paths into the resource library.
<code class=3D"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">PREFIX</code> lets us =
add a directory-like prefix to the path at runtime.</p>

