age-plaintext highlighter-rouge">file(GENERATE ...)</code> to
generate an intermediate file and then add a custom command to copy to the
final destination. That changes this line:</p>

<div class=3D"language-cmake highlighter-rouge"><div class=3D"highlight"><p=
